    "problem": "The paper addresses the challenge of determining whether projected greenhouse gas concentrations will raise Greenland's temperature beyond a critical warming threshold (~3 \u00b0C), a tipping point that would trigger the ice-sheet's irreversible melting and a substantial rise in global sea-level.",
    "method": "We calculated Greenland's future temperature using a simple climate model tuned to reproduce results from a range of complex climate models under various carbon dioxide stabilization scenarios to predict when the ice-sheet melting threshold will be crossed.",
    "task": "The task is to project future temperature changes in Greenland under various carbon dioxide scenarios to determine whether a critical warming threshold for the irreversible melting of the ice-sheet will be crossed.",
    "model": [
        "AOGCM"
    ],
